      <g:id>9267767214302</g:id>
      <g:title>Octopus Table Lamp</g:title>
      <g:description>Bring a touch of the ocean into your home with this handcrafted 3D printed Octopus Table Lamp. Its sculpted tentacles cradle the bulb, making it both a functional lamp and a unique conversation piece. Perfect for bedside tables, desks, living rooms or nautical-themed decor. Colour-shifting finish: printed in green-magenta-blue colour-shifting filament, the octopus changes colour as you move around it, shifting between green, magenta and blue depending on the viewing angle and the light. Each piece is printed layer by layer, so every lamp has its own distinctive finish. Note: Bulb and light assembly not included. Compatible with a normal (B22) bulb holder and standard LED bulbs. Compatible with the IKEA STRÅLA cord set. Base: 19 x 22 cm | Height: 25 cm</g:description>
